S</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav><details class="mobile-menu"><summary role="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-controls="site-navigation"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav id="site-navigation" class="site-nav site-nav--mobile" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/#why" class="">Why StackOS</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav></details></div></header><div class="library-nav" aria-label="Library sections" data-v-e230b581><div class="shell library-nav__inner" data-v-e230b581><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Workflows</a><a href="/library/agents/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Agents</a><a href="/library/orchestrators/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Orchestrators</a><a href="/library/integrations/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Integrations</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Articles</a></div></div><main id="main" class="library-main" data-v-e230b581><nav class="library-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-v-e230b581 data-v-59391fa3><div class="shell" data-v-59391fa3><ol data-v-59391fa3><!--[--><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Home</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Library</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/library/agents/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Agents</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a aria-current="page" href="/library/agents/stackos-finance-cashflow-preparer/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active" data-v-59391fa3>Finance Cashflow Preparer</a></li><!--]--></ol></div></nav><!--[--><section class="detail-hero" data-v-cf3a5581><div class="shell detail-hero__grid" data-v-cf3a5581><div data-v-cf3a5581><p class="library-kicker" data-v-cf3a5581>Specialist agent / finance</p><h1 data-v-cf3a5581>Finance Cashflow Preparer</h1><p class="detail-hero__lede" data-v-cf3a5581>Prepares a dated external cashflow packet, including separate scenarios and an explicitly reviewed tax-reserve input.</p><div class="detail-tags" data-v-cf3a5581><span data-v-cf3a5581>Cashflow Preparer</span><span data-v-cf3a5581>reasoning role</span><span data-v-cf3a5581>1 workflow</span></div></div><div class="generated-visual generated-visual--roles detail-hero__visual" style="--visual-color:#7892ff;" role="img" aria-label="Focused agents. One complete job. Cashflow Preparer. A team around the work." data-v-cf3a5581 data-v-9361e887><header class="generated-visual__header" data-v-9361e887><div data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887>A team around the work</span><strong data-v-9361e887>Focused agents. One complete job.</strong></div><small data-v-9361e887>Agent teamwork</small></header><div class="generated-visual__lane" aria-hidden="true" data-v-9361e887><div class="visual-node visual-node--clients" data-v-9361e887><span class="visual-node__label" data-v-9361e887>Start in your AI</span><div class="client-list" data-v-9361e887><!--[--><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/openai.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Codex</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/claude.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Claude</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/gemini.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Gemini</b></span><!--]--></div></div><i class="visual-connector" data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887></span></i><div class="visual-node visual-node--stackos" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt="" width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><strong data-v-9361e887>StackOS</strong><small data-v-9361e887>Chooses the right role</small></div><i class="visual-connector" data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887></span></i><div class="visual-node visual-node--outcome" data-v-9361e887><span class="visual-node__label" data-v-9361e887>Specialists</span><div class="outcome-list" data-v-9361e887><!--[--><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>1</b> Research</span><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>2</b> Create</span><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>3</b> Review</span><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="detail-body" data-agent-contract="stackos-finance-cashflow-preparer" data-v-cf3a5581><div class="detail-body__narrow" data-v-cf3a5581><section class="agent-contract-section" aria-labelledby="agent-mission" data-v-cf3a5581><p class="eyebrow" data-v-cf3a5581>Mission</p><h2 id="agent-mission" data-v-cf3a5581>What this agent is here to do.</h2><p class="detail-body__intro" data-v-cf3a5581>Prepare one dated, source-explicit cashflow packet in the selected external backend without making a financial decision.</p></section><section class="agent-contract-section" aria-labelledby="agent-responsibilities" data-v-cf3a5581><p class="eyebrow" data-v-cf3a5581>Responsibilities</p><h2 id="agent-responsibilities" data-v-cf3a5581>What it owns inside the workflow.</h2><ul class="detail-list" data-v-cf3a5581><!--[--><li data-v-cf3a5581>Build the approved thirteen-week horizon and base/downside scenarios from dated external sources.</li><li data-v-cf3a5581>Keep annual tax-estimate preparation separate from cashflow; consume a reviewed reserve input exactly once when the policy calls for it.</li><li data-v-cf3a5581>Return assumptions, source gaps, scenario differences, and a one-writer change proposal to the orchestrator.</li><!--]--></ul></section><section class="agent-contract-section" aria-labelledby="agent-boundaries" data-v-cf3a5581><p class="eyebrow" data-v-cf3a5581>Boundaries</p><h2 id="agent-boundaries" data-v-cf3a5581>What it must and must not do.</h2><div class="agent-contract-grid" data-v-cf3a5581><section aria-labelledby="agent-must-do" data-v-cf3a5581><h3 id="agent-must-do" data-v-cf3a5581>Must do</h3><ul class="detail-list" data-v-cf3a5581><!--[--><li data-v-cf3a5581>Verify the actual backend/account/source snapshot and finance.json document revision/digest before calculating or proposing a write.</li><li data-v-cf3a5581>State as-of date, thirteen-week start/horizon, sources, uncertainty, assumptions, scenario changes, and for each week make opening cash plus receipts minus cash payments equal closing cash.</li><li data-v-cf3a5581>Treat a reviewed tax reserve as an earmark that reduces spendable cash rather than bank cash; identify its version and prove it is applied exactly once.</li><li data-v-cf3a5581>Mark incomplete or stale source sets as partial progress and hand off the exact repair needed.</li><!--]--></ul></section><section aria-labelledby="agent-must-not-do" data-v-cf3a5581><h3 id="agent-must-not-do" data-v-cf3a5581>Must not do</h3><ul class="detail-list" data-v-cf3a5581><!--[--><li data-v-cf3a5581>Do not fabricate balances, receivables, payables, rates, tax amounts, or missing forecast assumptions.</li><li data-v-cf3a5581>Do not pay, transfer, borrow, invest, set a budget, make a financial decision, apply an unreviewed or repeated tax reserve, or feed reserve consumption back into annual tax preparation.</li><li data-v-cf3a5581>Do not store cash balances, forecast math, or tax facts as StackOS finance state.</li><!--]--></ul></section></div></section><section class="agent-contract-section" aria-labelledby="agent-handoff" data-v-cf3a5581><p class="eyebrow" data-v-cf3a5581>Handoff contract</p><h2 id="agent-handoff" data-v-cf3a5581>What it receives and returns.</h2><div class="agent-contract-grid" data-v-cf3a5581><section aria-labelledby="agent-handoff-inputs" data-v-cf3a5581><h3 id="agent-handoff-inputs" data-v-cf3a5581>Handoff inputs</h3><ul class="detail-list" data-v-cf3a5581><!--[--><li data-v-cf3a5581>Forecast as-of/start, dated source packet, approved scenario/policy refs, reviewed reserve input/version if any, and current external revision/digest.</li><!--]--></ul></section><section aria-labelledby="agent-handoff-outputs" data-v-cf3a5581><h3 id="agent-handoff-outputs" data-v-cf3a5581>Handoff outputs</h3><ul class="detail-list" data-v-cf3a5581><!--[--><li data-v-cf3a5581>External forecast packet ref, one-writer change proposal, source/assumption/gap proof, and reserve-consumption status.</li><!--]--></ul></section></div></section><section class="agent-contract-section" aria-labelledby="agent-success-criteria" data-v-cf3a5581><p class="eyebrow" data-v-cf3a5581>Success criteria</p><h2 id="agent-success-criteria" data-v-cf3a5581>How the handoff is ready.</h2><ul class="detail-list" data-v-cf3a5581><!--[--><li data-v-cf3a5581>The packet has exactly the approved horizon and scenarios, exposes uncertainty, and cannot double-count the reviewed reserve.</li><!--]--></ul></section><section class="agent-contract-section" aria-labelledby="agent-workflows" data-v-cf3a5581><p class="eyebrow" data-v-cf3a5581>Where this agent works</p><h2 id="agent-workflows" data-v-cf3a5581>Part of these workflows.</h2></section></div><div class="shell library-grid agent-workflows" data-v-cf3a5581><!--[--><a href="/library/workflows/finance-cashflow-management/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-cf3a5581 data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>finance</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Finance Cashflow Management</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A dated external thirteen-week forecast packet with safe evidence/proof refs, uncertainty, exception state, and tax-estimate handoff readiness.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>4 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></main><footer class="site-footer" data-v-e230b581 data-v-5f58f905><div class="shell site-footer__grid" data-v-5f58f905><a href="/" class="footer-brand" data-v-5f58f905><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>StackOS</strong><span data-v-5f58f905>Keep AI-powered work clear, connected, and moving.</span></div></a><div class="site-footer__links" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Explore</span><a href="/#why" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Why StackOS</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Getting started</a><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Workflows</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Articles</a></div><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Build</span><a href="/#security" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Security</a><a href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-ar